<section class="hot-chapter hot-wrap" id="thanksgiving">
  <div class="hot-chapter-head">
    <div>
      <p class="hot-eyebrow">Thursday, November 26</p>
      <h2>Thanksgiving: keep the stuffing, change the bird</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="hot-lede">The one irreplaceable recipe is the stuffing. Build the rest of the table around it: a showpiece steelhead main, a warm squash-and-spice shrimp for the people who do not want another fillet, and sides that travel.</p>
      <ul class="hot-hooks">
        <li>Crispy skin is the leftover people fight over. Put the steelhead skin back on top of the stuffing.</li>
        <li>Apple cider and brown butter already taste like the holiday. The fish is the quiet center of the plate.</li>
        <li>Make the farro salad the day before. It gets better overnight.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
